 "about_text": "Cevera Yoon Gallery is a contemporary art space in Los Angeles, founded in 2024 by Kyle Slevira and Green Yoon. Located within the historic Granada building in Koreatown, the gallery occupies over 1,100 square feet across multiple showrooms. Its program is dedicated to presenting both established and emerging artists, offering a platform for innovative and experimental work. The gallery has also participated in art fairs, presenting group exhibitions that explore abstraction across painting and sculpture, engaging with themes of materiality, structure, and the tension between order and entropy in contemporary art practice.",
